    """Newest completed feature-run entry recorded on the base run, or None.

    Feature files live under ``feature_runs/<id>/features/`` (SW-589), not at the
    base-run root, so the resume check must look them up through this lineage
    rather than through ``REQUIRED_ARTIFACTS['features']`` base-run paths.
