input.description:
Found during SW-589 (model-report review). Remaining parts of finding L17 (the CSV-by-mtime sub-item is already fixed, b8c9813).

Open, pending a decision from Eran:
- greyzone boundary inconsistent between the model report (inclusive) and the feature report;
- "High Risk Summary" labelled Test but uses roc_curve_set rows;
- age computed vs today, not the sample/collection date;
- no confidence intervals anywhere (AUC, sensitivity/specificity, PPV/NPV).

Emailed to Eran 2026-11-26. Status: WAITING on Eran. Findings reference: L17 in docs/pipeline_review_findings.md.

